B.K_=new A.O("newwill","Unsigned New Will","cellar",0,"Locked in the strongbox, a draft to be signed today: \u201cI revoke all bequests to my niece Tira Misu. My butler, G. Cracker, is dismissed without pension. Both know why. Everything goes to the Donut County Home for Day-Old Pastries.\u201d",B.cw,B.i,"strongbox",B.k,B.c,!1,null)
