B.QI=s(["Please send a modern housekeeper at once.","The present one, P. Cotta,","is to be retired","without notice or pension.","She makes the same puddings as ever."],t.s)
B.Kg=new A.O("retire","Letter to an Agency","study",0,"On Mrs. Senclair's desk, ready to post: \u201cPlease send a modern housekeeper at once. The present one, P. Cotta, is to be retired without notice or pension. She makes the same puddings she made thirty years ago.\u201d",B.bn,B.J,null,B.fR,B.QI,!1,null)
