B.adm=new A.m("where","Where were you around 11 last night?","In the parlor, darling, with Madame Leine's spring catalogue, from half past ten. I rang for cocoa just before eleven, Graham brought it, and I held him captive until twenty past. He has no opinions about feathers whatsoever.",B.c,B.c,null)
B.aco=new A.m("suspect","Who do you suspect?","Somebody who drinks, darling. Auntie had started counting the bottles, and nobody counts bottles unless bottles are going.",B.c,B.c,null)
B.abK=new A.m("voice",u.k,"For forty minutes, darling, straight above my head. That same old siege. And do you know, he never once said \u201cwhat\u201d. He says \u201cwhat\u201d after everything. I thought the Brigadier must have died.",B.el,B.c,null)
B.abw=new A.m("gramophone","The gramophone is up on the landing.","So THAT is where it went. I wanted a waltz at half past ten and it had vanished out of the parlor. I assumed Graham had confiscated it again.",B.lH,B.c,null)
B.T1=s([B.adm,B.dL,B.aco,B.abK,B.abw,B.dI,B.dN,B.cG,B.cY],t.q)
B.aeb=new A.m("where","Where were you around 11 last night?","Out in the greenhouse 'til midnight, coverin' the strawberries against the frost. I could hear the Colonel boomin' down the telephone clear across the garden the whole time. Penny let me in \u2014 door was latched. Left me boots on the mat.",B.c,B.c,null)
B.ab3=new A.m("suspect","Who do you suspect?","Butler's got the keys to that cellar, guv. Nobody else. And he's been lookin' sick as a parrot ever since she started countin'.",B.c,B.c,null)
B.qO=s(["strawbeds"],t.s)
B.adt=new A.m("beds","Not one of your strawberries is covered.","Ah. Well. I did the ones inside, see. Them outside beds is past savin'. No sense wastin' a good cloth.",B.qO,B.c,null)
B.Kv=new A.O("frostlog","Barry's Frost Log","",0,"A seed packet, pencilled on the back in Barry's hand: \u201cThurs night. Hard frost. Covered all the strawbs, 10 till 12. Sky clear as a bell and a full moon, bright enough to work by. No lamp wanted.\u201d",B.cw,B.J,null,B.k,B.c,!1,"barry")
B.ae3=new A.m("log","Can you show me what you did out there last night?","Wrote it all down, guv, like I always do. Back of a seed packet. Take it. That's two hours' honest graft, that is.",B.qO,B.c,B.Kv)
B.RX=s(["frostlog"],t.s)
B.ae_=new A.m("moon","The Colonel says he watched your lamp. You say you had none.","Did he? He'll have seen the moon on the glass, I expect. Bright old night, it was.",B.RX,B.lx,null)
B.Rf=s(["chute"],t.s)
B.ael=new A.m("chute","The coal hatch was unbolted, with your glaze on it.","Coalman uses that, guv. Bolt's on the outside so he can tip a load in. Anybody could draw it. And I lean on that wall every day of me life.",B.Rf,B.c,null)
B.Ts=s(["sootsocks"],t.s)
B.ac5=new A.m("socks","There is custard on your socks.","I shovel in me socks, guv, saves the boots. And Penny gives me the custard skins. Must've dropped a bit.",B.Ts,B.c,null)
B.acw=new A.m("seeds",u.E,"I'm through that cellar ten times a day to get to me boiler, guv. I shed seeds like a dog sheds hair.",B.qL,B.c,null)
B.aby=new A.m("prints","Your hand is on the end of the cask.","Helped the butler chock it Saturday, didn't I. Ask him. Heavy old thing.",B.aZ,B.c,null)
B.abr=new A.m("port",u.G,"Not me, guv. Wouldn't know port from paraffin. I'm a tea man.",B.lB,B.c,null)
